  "_about": "THE MACAQUE (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/bigmam/macaque.py, written whole on its own rig in its standing pose): a rhesus macaque male, ~0.5 m long, the tail ~0.2 m. Stocky and compact on shorter limbs than a baboon's, walking on palms and soles; a round head with a SHORT muzzle, the BARE PINK FACE flat round close-set eyes under a low brow, pink lids, small rounded ears close to the skull, the crown hair brushed back; grey-brown agouti fur turning golden-orange over the loins and rump, pink callosities, a SHORT drooping tail. Coats: rhesus, the JAPANESE macaque (snow monkey: thick silver-grey fur, a deep red face), the barbary-like pale brown.",
